---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import pricingMenu from '../assets/pricing-menu.png';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="services" class="bg-slate-50 py-20">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6">
		<span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-purple-600">Services &amp; Pricing</span>
		<h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-slate-800 sm:text-4xl">What it costs to pamper your pet</h2>
		<p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-slate-600">
			Pricing is based on your pet's breed, weight, and coat condition. Add-ons like de-shedding, nail
			grinding, and teeth brushing can be added to any service.
		</p>

		<div class="mt-10 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3 shadow-lg sm:p-6">
			<Image
				src={pricingMenu}
				alt="Katy's Pampered Paws price list: baths and full grooms for poodles, doodles, other breeds, and cats, plus add-on services. All services are subject to price changes depending on pet's behavior and/or condition of coat."
				width={900}
				class="mx-auto w-full rounded-xl"
			/>
		</div>

		<p class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate-500">
			Not sure which service is right for your pet? <a href={site.phoneHref} class="font-semibold text-teal-600 hover:text-teal-700">Call or text {site.phone}</a> for a quote.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>
